  "body": "[MSC3771](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3771) and [MSC3773](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3773) make changes to the receipt and notifications architecture for handling threads.\r\n\r\n* [x] Develop proof of concept for MSC3771 and MSC3773 together\r\n* [x] MSC3773: Notifications for threads\r\n\t* [x] Update the notifications schema to handle a `thread` field.\r\n\t* [x] Update the push rule handling code to attach thread to notifications.\r\n\t* [x] Update the notification rotation code to handle unique `thread`s.\r\n\t* [x] Update the sync code to return notifications separately for each thread.\r\n* [x] MSC3771: Read receipts for threads\r\n\t* [x] Update the `/receipt` servlet handling for `thread`.\r\n\t* [x] Update the receipt schema to handle `thread` (and properly handle it when not provided).\r\n\t* [x] Update the fetching of receipts to handle unique `thread`s.\r\n\t* [x] Update the sync code to return the `thread` of each receipt.",
